      "ref_handle": "blk-ecme3g",
      "text": "EXPECT: every task in every state; todo rank first, doing next, done last."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E5XRN47A79W9524TZDE",
      "line": 27,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:82c3ba738f1adbc311a9b28335a5f6ab0e6ae8cb9b4ac87400ce1d7d5241d20a",
      "ref_handle": "blk-24tzde",
      "text": "Comma inside a tag value: the tag alphabet is letters, digits, dash, underscore and slash only, so the comma is a parse error, not a union. Unions over tags are spelled as repeated tag: lines, as the next fence shows."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E66BSMB3SY8XMJ3C8WC",
      "line": 28,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:41ec01033101a21c67e28a64c56d4ca7833a81338d450de6bd682d82afcbef1d",
      "ref_handle": "blk-j3c8wc",
      "text": "```query\ntag: rebel, jedi\nsort: page\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF21D62BKCRRRSF4Z27QRY",
      "line": 29,
      "indent": 1,
      "content_hash": "sha256:7bfea49b1191855afe65f672e3ed36b6d2fd86819582c283e7113943c97cd7c0",
      "ref_handle": "blk-z27qry",
      "text": "> **result:** `error: line 1: tag 'rebel, jedi' contains ',', which cannot appear in a tag (letters, digits, '-', '_' and '/' only)`"
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E6E2CX40SH6GPN1V7WP",
      "line": 30,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:d9ab2b027e667e90525a728450e563be3c4b90fb2c7ff1ff44bfe6857c15c531",
      "ref_handle": "blk-n1v7wp",
      "text": "EXPECT: line 1 error — tag contains a comma, which cannot appear in a tag (letters, digits, dash, underscore and slash only)."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E6QW8JMZP2G316J599Y",
      "line": 31,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:0e081744a8fdaa96bedd8bb6d6c6c260605967477d7dad24f936c7b047f9a0c7",
      "ref_handle": "blk-6j599y",
      "text": "Two filters on one key AND: a block survives only if it carries both #tatooine and #rebel. Repeated lines exclude more, they do not widen."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E71EB163HQYMW1VH34C",
      "line": 32,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:5c57677006ac677aed75a7cba7ee421634c3305084f645aa38c641da5f82c95e",
      "ref_handle": "blk-1vh34c",
      "text": "```query\ntag: tatooine\ntag: rebel\nsort: page\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF21Z2DMMPTW475Y5H8X92",
      "line": 33,
      "indent": 1,
      "content_hash": "sha256:fb37b87649a9a9ea1305c983224cec46f8791c12ca78e1c0cdb42a23d408e620",
      "ref_handle": "blk-5h8x92",
      "text": "> **result:** (2 blocks)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF2CZ9THG7DRWQPBMX762Q",
      "line": 34,
      "indent": 2,
      "content_hash": "sha256:468f3d5d45ecd3757e6842581bf9b93612d25846442959b3c652654347444774",
      "ref_handle": "blk-mx762q",
      "text": "!((blk-6j599y))"
    },
    {
