      "ref_handle": "blk-6e30ea",
      "text": "!((blk-1kpw1r))"
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E7AT25DDDGFPC30MFP5",
      "line": 36,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:6f08577341ca2d49fadcb16c67a53e3fe24a709bc44c19d58970b36b81cc5bfa",
      "ref_handle": "blk-30mfp5",
      "text": "EXPECT: two hits - Rally point carries both #tatooine and #rebel; this comment also answers because prose naming both tags counts as carrying them. Repeated lines AND, they do not widen.EXPECT: two hits - Rally point carries both #tatooine and #rebel; this comment also answers because prose naming both tags counts as carrying them. Repeated lines AND, they do not widen."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E7NM11K58CMN8GXP4T8",
      "line": 37,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:053cb666968440491a03bbe2ca90fc5c191f240c47f0e25f53327a30cb8b36a3",
      "ref_handle": "blk-gxp4t8",
      "text": "Boundary match plus negation: keep blocks tagged #rebel, drop the ones also tagged #alliance. Matching stops at the tag boundary, so #rebellion is not matched by either side."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E7YA2CW21HYMJAF6FNM",
      "line": 38,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:3fa597376fff36ed04f929662c7e8c6526ce1b49269a31acd2d81657b81d60fe",
      "ref_handle": "blk-af6fnm",
      "text": "```query\ntag: rebel\nnot-tag: alliance\n```"
    },
