      "ref_handle": "blk-na1cdg",
      "text": "EXPECT: eight hits - plain #rebel blocks plus the nested #rebel/alliance block, whose slash segment is not a standalone tag so not-tag: alliance keeps it; this comment and this EXPECT answer through their prose mentions; #rebellion stays out.EXPECT: eight hits - plain #rebel blocks plus the nested #rebel/alliance block, whose slash segment is not a standalone tag so not-tag: alliance keeps it; this comment and this EXPECT answer through their prose mentions; #rebellion stays out."
    },
    {
