      "ref_handle": "blk-5pg6ee",
      "text": "Property presence and value: prop: due keeps blocks carrying a due:: property, and the :: value narrows it to one exact date. The double-colon spelling matches how properties are written in the .md."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0E9Q8PJ4W4AJ802C0K3J",
      "line": 57,
      "indent": 0,
