      "ref_handle": "blk-89rzra",
      "text": "EXPECT: Train at the Jedi temple — the only block carrying due:: 2026-02-15."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0EABXY3VC392C966JPG1",
      "line": 61,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:3f1115b4b71f39432fb22c61a66c223c40577c3df05fc1ed10f4983804313a09",
      "ref_handle": "blk-66jpg1",
      "text": "Journal window: kind: journal restricts to journal pages, since: 7d keeps entries dated inside the last seven days. Ordinary pages are not journals, so they never answer this fence."
    },
    {
      "id": "01M4SF0EANESS7WNK2DJ6SFS40",
      "line": 62,
      "indent": 0,
      "content_hash": "sha256:d1c45471b1e29f16e2c7b9f5eaa602f67bf8c98eb28296621fa1972bdacb972a",
      "ref_handle": "blk-6sfs40",
      "text": "```query\nkind: journal\nsince: 7d\nsort: page\n```"
    },
