      "ref_handle": "blk-eaf7xw",
      "text": "EXPECT: seven hits - every block of the today, minus-1d and minus-3d journals, counting the empty filler blocks and the [[q-fences]] ref line; the minus-30d survey falls outside the window.EXPECT: seven hits - every block of the today, minus-1d and minus-3d journals, counting the empty filler blocks and the [[q-fences]] ref line; the minus-30d survey falls outside the window."
    },
