      "ref_handle": "blk-tnr9mf",
      "text": "EXPECT: seven hits - Train, Meet Yoda, Upper case notes, Refit, plus this EXPECT and the two comments above that mention jedi tags in prose; the value matches #jedi and #Jedi alike.EXPECT: seven hits - Train, Meet Yoda, Upper case notes, Refit, plus this EXPECT and the two comments above that mention jedi tags in prose; the value matches #jedi and #Jedi alike."
    },
    {
